---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { useTranslations } from '../../utils/i18n';

const lang = 'en';
const t = useTranslations(lang);
---

<Layout 
  title="About Me | Cesar Santos · Physiotherapy & Integrative Health" 
  description="From the Mountain Troops to Integrative Health. Discover my story of reinvention, physiotherapy, Psychoneuroimmunology (PNI), and resilience." 
  lang={lang} 
  canonicalPath="/en/about-me"
>
  <div class="article-detail" style="max-width: 850px;">
    <span class="hero-subtitle">Trajectory, Resilience & Clinical Methodology</span>
    <h1 class="hero-title" style="margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 2.3rem; line-height: 1.25;">
      Cesar Santos · Physiotherapist in Integrative Health & Persistent Pain
    </h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 25px; border-left: 3px solid var(--color-secondary); padding-left: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">
      "What do you do when life turns out the lights overnight? You reinvent yourself."
    </p>

    <!-- Featured Hero Portrait of Cesar Santos -->
    <div class="bio-hero-container" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; align-items: center; margin: 30px 0 40px 0;">
      <div class="content-image-wrapper" style="margin: 0;">
        <img 
          src="/images/cesar_santos_portrait.webp" 
          alt="Cesar Santos - Physiotherapist in Integrative Health & PNI" 
          class="content-image" 
          style="border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-medium); width: 100%; max-height: 480px; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 3/4; object-position: top center;"
        />
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="lead-paragraph" style="margin: 0;">
          My vocation has always been service, discipline, and self-improvement. For years, my life was spent in the mountains, leading operational units. Today, I apply that same strategy and rigor to help people take control of their health and understand how the human body adapts.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8;">
      <div style="background-color: rgba(48, 62, 69, 0.04); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-secondary); padding: 25px; margin: 30px 0; border-radius: 4px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px; color: var(--text-color);">From the mountains to the front line</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--text-muted);">
          I trained at the <strong>General Military Academy</strong> and specialized in Infantry. I served as Lieutenant Platoon Leader in the <strong>Ski-Climbing Company</strong> and later as Captain, taking charge of the <strong>Intelligence Section of the "Galicia" 64 Mountain Hunters Regiment</strong>. Tactical planning, working under pressure, and physical and mental strength were my day-to-day life.
        </p>
        <div class="content-image-wrapper" style="margin: 15px 0 0 0;">
          <img src="/images/aragonese_pyrenees.webp" alt="Peaks of the Aragonese Pyrenees (Monte Perdido and Ordesa)" class="content-image" style="border-radius: 8px; max-height: 260px; object-fit: cover; width: 100%;" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 15px;">The turning point that changed everything</h2>
      <p>
        In the spring of 2020, during the COVID-19 lockdown and while serving in <strong>Operation Balmis</strong>, my life took a drastic turn. A close contact with COVID-19 triggered a venous sinus thrombosis that caused <strong>intracranial hypertension</strong>. This sustained pressure ultimately caused an <strong>atrophy in the optic nerves</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Within weeks, after fighting to maintain normalcy relying on the eye that still retained some vision, the condition affected both eyes. The outcome was a permanent condition with an 80% visual disability and my medical retirement from the Armed Forces.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Reinvention through movement and science</h2>
      <p>
        I could have given up, but I chose to apply military discipline to my own recovery. I returned to a passion I had since youth: deeply understanding how the human body functions through health.
      </p>
      <p>
        Affiliated with ONCE, I enrolled in the <strong>ONCE University School of Physiotherapy (Autonomous University of Madrid)</strong> and graduated in May 2025. Understanding pain and the body's capacity to adapt became not just an academic record, but a vital necessity.
      </p>

      <div style="background-color: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 30px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 35px 0;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px; color: var(--color-secondary);">Academic Background & Qualifications</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 0.98rem; color: var(--text-color);">
          Official university degree and specialized postgraduate training:
        </p>
        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-muted);">
          <li><strong>Bachelor's Degree in Physiotherapy</strong> – ONCE University School of Physiotherapy (EUFO - Autonomous University of Madrid).</li>
          <li><strong>Master's Degree in Musculoskeletal Physiotherapy "Orthopedic Manual Physical Therapy"</strong> – ONCE University School of Physiotherapy (EUFO).</li>
          <li><strong>Pilates Method Training</strong> – ONCE University School of Physiotherapy (EUFO).</li>
          <li><strong>Introduction to Clinical Psychoneuroimmunology (PNI)</strong> – Regenera.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 15px;">My mission today</h2>
      <p>
        I no longer lead troops in the mountains, but I remain in service to others. As a physiotherapist and someone who has personally experienced a devastating health change, my goal is to <strong>translate medical evidence into real solutions</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        I want to help patients overcome the fear of pain and understand how their lifestyle, immune system, and movement interconnect. At the same time, I share technical rigor and reflections with healthcare colleagues seeking an integrative view of human health.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Action & Contact CTA -->
    <div style="margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-top: 30px; display: flex; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;">
      <a href="/en/contact" class="btn-submit" style="width: auto;">
        Get in touch
      </a>
      <a href="/en/demystifying-pain" class="btn-link">
        Read scientific articles &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
